       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. B4STR.
      *> STRING / UNSTRING / INSPECT in a loop
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SRC PIC X(200).
       01 OUTB PIC X(400).
       01 PTR PIC 9(4) COMP.
       01 T PIC X(20).
       01 N PIC 9(4) COMP.
       01 I PIC 9(9) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE ALL "A" TO SRC
           MOVE 1 TO PTR
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 200000
               STRING SRC DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO OUTB
                   WITH POINTER PTR
               END-STRING
               IF PTR > 300 MOVE 1 TO PTR
           END-PERFORM
           INSPECT OUTB TALLYING N FOR ALL "A"
           UNSTRING SRC DELIMITED BY "B" INTO T
           DISPLAY N.
           STOP RUN.
